tly.</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Caption: work from the current published EYFS and Ofsted handbook for exact wording, which is being reformed. Quickler captures each row as a WhatsApp prompt and files the evidence against it. It is not a children's records, learning journal or child protection system, and holds no child's personal data.</p>"
